        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owotena, onwoŋo atemo i tekona luŋ me coyiwu waraga pi kop i kom larre ame wan luŋ onotte iye, eka ate neno ni, myero aco acuk kede cunywu me irom wunu atek pi iyee ame rik doŋ omio oko baŋ jo Obaŋa tyen acel ame oromo meicel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien jo mogo a mom lworo Obaŋa olibere aliba me donyo i akinawa, jo ame kop ame oŋolligi rik onyuto con i coc a yam ocoo, Gin oloko winyo ame Obaŋa imiowa odoko tim me tarwaŋ, okwero Adwoŋwa acel keken ame en Rwotwa Yecu Kricito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
