              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.1+NUM.16.2+NUM.16.3+NUM.16.4+NUM.16.5+NUM.16.6+NUM.16.7+NUM.16.8+NUM.16.9+NUM.16.10+NUM.16.11+NUM.16.12+NUM.16.13+NUM.16.14+NUM.16.15+NUM.16.16+NUM.16.17+NUM.16.18+NUM.16.19+NUM.16.20+NUM.16.21+NUM.16.22+NUM.16.23+NUM.16.24+NUM.16.25+NUM.16.26+NUM.16.27+NUM.16.28+NUM.16.29+NUM.16.30+NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32+NUM.16.33+NUM.16.34+NUM.16.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.1-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin obino neno can be! Pien gin wopo yo a Kain, oonyakino i tammogo a mom tye kakare pi mito lim bala rik Balaam, dok dan oto oko pi pyem bala rik Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin okelo lewic iyi aramawu me mar ka ogado cam aboŋo lworo, kun oparo ka pi komgi kengi. Gin ocalli pol ame pii mom iye ame yamo okolo; orom i yen ame nyiggi mom nen i kare me cekgi, ame oputo lwitgi oko, yam oto iryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocal dan i nam ame atagere ager, ame wowota atata, ame Obaŋa otyeko yiko kakargi oko i kabedo acol icuc pi kare a mom gik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
